
DestroyFunc TableTopOn
AddToFunc   TableTopOn
+ I All (FvwmPager) Iconify On
+ I All (FvwmButtons) Iconify On
+ I All (Mozilla-firefox-bin) Iconify On
+ I All (gkrellm) Iconify On
#+ I All sma Scale 0.5
+ I XineramaSlsSize 1x2
+ I XineramaSls On
+ I XineramaPrimaryScreen 1
+ I Xinerama On
+ I sma Surface On TableTop
+ I Exec fvwm-root --scale $[METISSE_FVWM_CONFIG_DIR]/images/backgrounds/tabletop.png
+ I All (Mozilla-bin) Iconify On

DestroyFunc TableTopOff
AddToFunc   TableTopOff
+ I All (FvwmPager) Iconify Off
+ I All (FvwmButtons) Iconify Off
+ I All (Mozilla-firefox-bin) Iconify Off
+ I All (gkrellm) Iconify Off
+ I XineramaSls Off
+ I Xinerama Off
+ I sma Surface Off
#+ I All sma Scale 2
+ I AFuncCheckAndSetScaledBg $[METISSE_FVWM_CONFIG_DIR]/images/backgrounds/sky-metisse.jpg
+ I All (Mozilla-bin) Iconify Off

PointerKey t A 4C TableTopOn
PointerKey g A 4C TableTopOff
